{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-store/src/queues/webhooks.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-25T07:49:08.781331Z","id":"782e6af131b6e07a000dbb3740e9d6b932dfa6a2e627be8bca74fc64bdee7b9c","body":{"detail":"Store::create_webhook queues a webhook.verify delivery each time; VERIFY_SENDS_PER_HOUR (crates/clax-core/src/webhook.rs) counts one endpoint's rows. A queue admin who adds and removes endpoints in a loop makes Clax post small signed verification requests to any public URL, each recorded as queue.update webhook_add/webhook_remove. A per-queue or per-URL hourly cap on verifications would close it.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":264},"end":{"line":276},"content_hash":"b944cb8f74de4f8807658118e67eefe8c00972bc2572e498a627552a56f61e01"},"summary":"Adding a webhook endpoint sends its URL one verification POST at once, and nothing caps how often an admin removes and adds endpoints, so the verification cap is per endpoint, not per URL or per queue","tags":["webhooks","abuse","session:claude-code:81ed4f00-a75f-41f2-a558-eb649b5b9f3d"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-store/src/queues/webhooks.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-25T08:28:50.306196Z","id":"25caba21c1bf04881ea7e7e30251305eb07743f0851f3920c04dc3532ba385dc","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:c1aa2b7d2","summary":"Verifications are now capped per queue (30 an hour, removed endpoints' included) and per host (60 an hour) in webhook_verify_sends; tests removing_and_adding_again_hits_the_queue_s_hourly_verification_cap and a_host_s_verifications_are_capped_across_queues (crates/clax-store/src/queues/webhooks.rs) and api_queue_webhooks::removing_and_adding_again_is_capped_per_queue pass under bazelisk test //crates/clax-store:all //crates/clax-server:all (22 of 22 pass)","supersedes":"782e6af131b6e07a000dbb3740e9d6b932dfa6a2e627be8bca74fc64bdee7b9c","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:81ed4f00-a75f-41f2-a558-eb649b5b9f3d"]}}
